It's all well and good when a game requires you to build entire civilizations, manage politics, and acquire wealth using available resources. But what if the world has fallen to the onslaught of extreme weather? What if the elements have destroyed everything that could be? And how can you save the people who are now completely alone in the wasteland and without any support? A game project called ENDCIV will tell you how you can survive in conditions of total destruction and what you need to do to receive a blessing from above that will allow you to survive.

Download ENDCIV It's worth torrenting because this isn't a settlement-building simulator; it's a true survival simulator where you'll have to find the smallest, most hopeless way to survive. There are no resources in this game; life unfolds in real-life conditions, and every item and food found is valued more than any resource on the planet.

Wooden beds, campfires, hopelessness, and utter madness — that's what awaits you in this game. You'll take control of a small group of people, and you'll have to provide them with overwhelming support, including shelter and food. You'll have to teach them, find weapons, build social relationships, save money, and defend your settlement from the raids of other, similarly crazed settlements.

ENDCIV You won't be led by the hand to victory; you'll need to demonstrate perseverance and endurance to achieve success and achieve victory. But before you do, remember that every false step could be your last on the path to prosperity and the possibility of living.

Game features:
- a world deprived of any hope of survival awaits a new hero;
- create from the ashes a new world, endowed with power and the spark of life;
- skillfully manage your capabilities, especially when it comes to the military sphere;
- Get ready, a real world on the brink of destruction awaits you, which will test your skills and will to survive.
